# Narvar OTP Daily Routine — Claude Code Script

Run this each morning at 9:00 AM ET. It queries Snowflake for rolling 7-day
DFLs, RPL, and top advertisers per publisher, detects flags, and posts a
formatted summary to `#test-narvar-claude`.

---

## Setup

1. Install Claude Code if you haven't: `npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code`
2. Make sure your Slack MCP is connected in Claude Code (it uses your existing
   claude.ai Slack connection).
3. Save the prompt below to a file, e.g. `narvar_daily.md`, then run:

```bash
claude --print narvar_daily.md
```

To schedule it at 9:00 AM ET every weekday, add a cron job:

```bash
# Open crontab
crontab -e

# Add this line (runs M-F at 9:00 AM ET, adjust TZ as needed)
0 9 * * 1-5 TZ="America/New_York" claude --print /path/to/narvar_daily.md >> /tmp/narvar_daily.log 2>&1
```

