## Notes

- **RPUT**: `NARVAR_DAILY_PERFORMANCE` needs to be backfilled before RPUT can
  be included. Once backfilled, add a Step 2b pulling
  `SUM(platform_revenue) / SUM(unique_tracks)` per publisher. Flag threshold:
  >15% WoW decline. Add RPUT column to the All Publishers table.

- **Portfolio escalation**: If two publishers with the same parent company
  (e.g. Victoria's Secret + Savage X Fenty) are both flagged, note this
  explicitly and recommend escalating together.

- **Advertiser watch**: Low-CPM advertisers (e.g. Shipments Free) appearing
  as new top-5 entries across 2+ publishers in the same week signal network-level
  fill rate dilution — always call out in the Network TLDR and flag to demand team.
